cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Fleet dbt Warehouse"
abstract: >-
  A daily analytics warehouse for fleet logistics operations. Contract-validated
  extracts from MySQL and MongoDB land in PostgreSQL bronze, dbt transforms them
  through silver and gold into BI marts, and five approved non-PII marts are
  published to Databricks. Airflow orchestrates the daily run, and a read-only
  Streamlit site shows live run, dbt and data-quality audit status.
